---------------------------------

SDS (Simple Dynamic Strings), a private copy, not a library that is
installed beside StormByte.

  What it is     the long-string buffer used by Safe::String
  How it is used compiled into libStormByte. It is not a separate .so or .dll
  Source         https://github.com/StormBytePP/sds
                 commit cc59ce0b12e91521476ad54a1e069fb6fd933bbc
