  License        the notice in the compiled sources, reproduced in COPYING.SDS
                 The same file also includes the shorter LICENSE from that
                 commit. Read COPYING.SDS. Do not treat this paragraph as the
                 license.

The MSVC change in that commit is a ssize_t typedef. It does not replace
the copyright notice in sds.c.

wbuf, the wide buffer next to SDS, is original StormByte source. It is
covered by LICENSE, not by COPYING.SDS.

Nothing else is compiled into this library from outside this repository.
Bcrypt on Windows is an import of the system library, not code shipped here.
